OL,3,ATech stock sell-off drags markets down
OL,4,Aas Anthropic shares slide
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnthropic's shares have dropped back
OL,7,Ftowards their initial price after a
OL,8,Fsoaring first day on the stock market,
OL,9,Fas a wider tech sell-off dragged
OL,10,Fmarkets down.
OL,12,FThe sell-off comes as concerns remain
OL,13,Fover the speed and size of artificial
OL,14,Fintelligence investment, but also as
OL,15,Fsome large companies including Nvidia
OL,16,Fand SpaceX faced specific issues that
OL,17,Fworried investors.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
