OL,3,AFight over fossil fuels leaves COP31
OL,4,Aclimate talks in deadlock
OL,5,
OL,6,FNegotiating teams due to fly out on
OL,7,FSunday morning are now moving their
OL,8,Fflights to Monday in a sign that a deal
OL,9,Fis not yet in sight.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
